# The owner's own reference material: 53 files, 9,2 MB, a WhatsApp export plus 51
# annotated TradingView screenshots. NOT tracked and deliberately so - it is his
# journal, not source - but it was not ignored either, so it sat in `git status`
# forever as 53 untracked paths. Ignored here for two reasons, and the second is
# the load-bearing one:
#
#   1. `git status` becomes readable again.
#   2. `git clean -fd` cannot take it. It is cited by name in twelve tracked
#      places - `app/projections.py` and `tests/test_projections.py` name
#      `27.jpeg` as the provenance of a shipped sign convention - and because it
#      is not in git, deleting it is unrecoverable.
analisis lama/

# Snapshot pengamatan lokal. Bukan cache: cache boleh dihapus kapan saja,
# snapshot yang terhapus adalah pengamatan yang hilang. Tidak pernah di-commit -
# isinya keadaan akun dan keputusan pribadi.
backend/.snapshots/
